# =============================================================================
# Thought/Final-Answer Abnormal Line-Ratio Detection
# =============================================================================
# Detects LLM responses finally classified as thought/final_answer whose
# non-empty lines contain a configurable substring beyond a ratio threshold.
# For thought: appends a critical user observation warning the model.
# For final/final_answer: converts the step back to thought (task NOT
# terminated) and injects the same critical observation so the model gets
# another chance to produce a well-formed step.
# Master switch. Set to 1 to enable, 0 to disable (default off).
TOPSAILAI_THOUGHT_LINE_PATTERN_ENABLED=0

# JSON list of detection rules. Each rule:
#   pattern       (required) substring a non-empty line must contain
#   line_ratio    (required, 0 < value <= 1) trigger when matched/total STRICTLY > this
#   min_lines     (optional, default 5) minimum non-empty lines before evaluation
#   case_sensitive(optional, default true)
#   enabled       (optional, default true)
#   dedup         (optional, default true) warn once per sustained over-threshold period
#   agent_role    (optional, default *) manager|worker|*
#   warning       (optional) custom template; placeholders {pattern} {matched}
#                 {total} {actual_ratio} {line_ratio} {agent_role} {step_type}
# Example:
# TOPSAILAI_THOUGHT_LINE_PATTERN_RULES='[{"pattern":"topsailai.","line_ratio":0.9,"min_lines":5}]'
TOPSAILAI_THOUGHT_LINE_PATTERN_RULES=""
